  "description": "A single-storey rear extension to the lower flat, This will provide a more functional and proportionate kitchen/living space - living space in the lower flat (48B) is inadequate.  \n\nIn order to build the extension to the full width of the existing, the current spiral staircase for the upper flat needs to be removed and replaced with a linear staircase in the alley. This will improve privacy between the two flats, as Flat A overlooks Flat B at the top of the staircase.  A modest, polycarbonate screen is proposed for the party wall with Number 50, to maintain privacy with the new, linear staircase.  \n\nThe rearrangement of the garden access staircase will allow the upstairs bedroom of the lower flat to be enlargened. \n",
